\p{\paragraph{Meditations Translation.} Another quote about how we should treat death like any other universal truth of the world. In this instance, he chooses to compare to your weight. }
\remark{I really do not get the hype about this book. It is like 10\% insightful and 90\% forcing the same concepts down your throat.}
